  exerciseName: CannotStartQuests
  exerciseTitle: Cannot start Quests
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459489
  exerciseText: Cannot start quests
  hintText: Is the issue on the Quest System? Or the Interaction System? How many
    colliders is the physics query finding?
  solutionText: The Interaction System has the wrong TryGetComponent type, it is
    looking for a Transform instead of a IInteractable.
